#: ../../../build_and_test.md:9
msgid ""
"**The overlay mode** - In this mode, one uses the static archive from LLVM's "
"libc along with the system libc. See {ref}`overlay_mode` for more details on "
"building and using the libc in this mode. To run the tests, one simply does:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build_and_test.md:18
msgid ""
"Note that only the tests for functions that are part of the overlay static "
"archive are run by the above command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build_and_test.md:21
msgid ""
"**The full build mode** - In this mode, the libc is used as the only libc "
"for the user's application. See {ref}`full_host_build` for more details on "
"building and using the libc in this mode. Once configured for a full libc "
"build, the same command builds the tests against LLVM-libc's own headers and "
"startup code and runs them:"
msgstr ""

