msgid ""
"Shared tests - You can run tests for shared, standalone components (like "
"math primitives) without needing the full libc runtime by the command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build_and_test.md:45
msgid ""
"A change should be tested in both modes. See {ref}`testing_guide` for the "
"kinds of tests, how to run a single test, and how to confirm that a test was "
